    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-06T09:20:04+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-06T09:20:04+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-05T22:50:04Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-05T22:50:04Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system over southern SA moves over the eastern states, as a cold front clips the southeast on today. Another high pressure system moves over waters to the south of SA over the weekend, while a developing low pressure system and trough in WA move close to the SA border. The high drifts southeast of Australia as the low moves across SA on Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW005" description="Lower South East" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-06T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-07T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-05T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-06T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the afternoon and evening. Possible small hail in the south at night. Winds northwesterly 20 to 30 km/h increasing to 35 km/h before turning southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h in the late afternoon. Daytime maximum temperatures in the low 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">No Rating</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 4:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-07T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-08T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-06T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-07T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the south, most likely in the early morning. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Winds south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h increasing to 30 km/h before tending south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 8 with daytime temperatures reaching around 17.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-08T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-07T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Light winds becoming easterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 2 and 7 with daytime temperatures reaching around 20.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds easterly 15 to 20 km/h turning northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to around 7 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
